# IN—Input From Port -- override
# The manual's Operation: "IF ((PE = 1) and ((CPL > IOPL) or (VM = 1)))
# THEN (* Protected mode with CPL > IOPL or virtual-8086 mode *) IF (Any I/O
# Permission Bit for I/O port being accessed = 1) THEN #GP(0);" -- the
# bitmap check is IOPermitted (lib.sdm) -- then 'DEST := SRC' from the port.
@operation
IF IOPermitted(SRC, OperandSize / 8) = 0 THEN #GP(0); FI;
In(DEST, SRC);
